ing, then the children enter"]},{"id":"present","label":"Teams present the bikes, adjust fit, ride with the children","duration":15,"details":["Roaming photography throughout"]},{"id":"photo","label":"Group photograph","duration":5,"details":["This is the photograph the event is remembered by"]},{"id":"tunnel","label":"Human tunnel","duration":3,"details":["Participants form the tunnel, children run out through it"]},{"id":"reset","label":"Room reset for the debrief","duration":4,"details":["Build tables cleared, seating pulled in"]},{"id":"debrief","label":"Debrief, facilitated by James Carter","duration":20,"details":["Open with: who has the first bike story?","What happened, so what, now what"]},{"id":"challenge","label":"30-Day Challenge","duration":4,"details":["Voluntary, SMS based, no app","Custom client page and QR code on screen"]},{"id":"close","label":"Close: client executive","duration":4,"details":["Connects the session to the client''s definition of leadership"]},{"id":"inspection","label":"Technician inspection","duration":60,"after_close":true,"details":["Every bicycle inspected and corrected at the venue"]}],"beneficiary_track":[{"id":"confirm","label":"Beneficiary org confirms departure, chaperones and consent","offset_from_reveal":-1440},{"id":"depart_origin","label":"Children depart the beneficiary site","offset_from_reveal":-75},{"id":"arrive_venue","label":"Children arrive and go directly to the holding room, out of sight of the main room","offset_from_reveal":-45},{"id":"holding","label":"Chaperones and support staff run activities, snacks and drinks","offset_from_reveal":-45,"duration":30},{"id":"sizing","label":"Sizing and helmet fitting","offset_from_reveal":-15},{"id":"send_rep","label":"One participant from each team is sent to the holding room to meet their child","offset_from_reveal":-15},{"id":"match","label":"Participants matched with children; children briefed and lined up outside the room","offset_from_reveal":-10,"duration":10},{"i